CirDial implements a virtual USB HID System Multi-Axis Controller through a
loopback USB/IP device server on Windows. The public source contains the USB
interface implementation and descriptors, native dial UI, settings, shared
protocol and tests. There is no physical PCB or hardware firmware. We request
one stable identity for the same device implementation on ARM64 and x64,
instead of requiring end users to register individual product identities.
